OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, then a band of heavy rain
OL,7,Fsweeps through quickly overnight,
OL,8,Fclearing the region by dawn. Very
OL,9,Fstrong winds, turning to gales at the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,13,Fisolated, but occasionally heavy
OL,14,Fshowers and plenty of sunny spells.
OL,15,FFeeling fresh in the strong breeze,
OL,16,Fthis easing through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
