OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fshowery start to Wednesday before
OL,7,Fturning drier and brighter by
OL,8,Fafternoon. Overnight fog patches clear
OL,9,Fto sunny spells and light winds
OL,10,FThursday, then cloud starts to build
OL,11,Fagain Friday.
